  "body": "## Question\n\nHow should the shop list be sorted?\n\n## Context\n\nThe list has 40 items, and players say that the cheap ones are hard to find.\n\n## Options\n\n- A: Sort by name only. Nothing changes.\n- B: Sort by price only. Items with the same price show in no fixed order.\n- C: Sort by price, then by name. It needs one more sort key.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nC: the same price always shows the same order.\n\n## Docs\n\n- docs/guides/setup.md#installing\n\n## Raised by\n\nSession fixture-session-4.\n\n## Waits on this\n\nThe shop screen.\n",
